cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Oncoprint Builder"
abstract: "A whitelist/blacklist-driven tool for building oncoprints from annotated variant data, using editable note files and a reviewable gene CSV instead of hardcoded gene vectors. Parses SnpEff-annotated VCFs or any long variant table, and renders with ComplexHeatmap."
